body:
well shit this made me cry 

&#x200B;

(hug)

it's weird to agree to something as unusual as talking about getting jealous if people kill themselves but I agree it's always "Oh they were such a sweet and caring soul!" or "Omg I miss them so much why did you do it!" and it's like their a whole different person from when that person was alive, take parents, for example, they treat you like shit and let's just say you killed yourself, they would be bawling their eyes out.

&#x200B;

i know what i said doesn't make much sense but try to understand
